tenteram.\\nKalau Mama lelah,\\ntidur saja di pelukanku.\\nAku akan tetap belajar\\nmembuat Mama bangga.\\n\\n[Outro]\\nSelamat ulang tahun, Mama Sri,\\nsemoga bahagiamu berlimpah.\\nDi setiap doa, nama Mama\\nselalu ada di hatiku.\\nAku sayang Mama, selalu...\\nSelamat ulang tahun, Mama.\",\"sourceAudioUrl\":\"\",\"sourceImageUrl\":\"https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.jpeg\",\"sourceStreamAudioUrl\":\"https://audiostream.api.box/stream/9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.mp3\",\"source_audio_url\":\"\",\"source_image_url\":\"https://cdn2.suno.ai/image_9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.jpeg\",\"source_stream_audio_url\":\"https://audiostream.api.box/stream/9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.mp3\",\"streamAudioUrl\":\"https://audiostream.api.box/stream/9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.mp3\",\"stream_audio_url\":\"https://audiostream.api.box/stream/9088757f-a682-4611-a536-dac1cd112d12.mp3\",\"tags\":\"Modern birthday pop, warm, joyful and tender at 96 BPM with a gentle bounce; close-miked piano and guitar in a soft studio mix; young female vocal with a bright, clear-toned, powerful full-voice belt; strummed acoustic guitar and ukulele, glockenspiel accents, light drums and synth pads, with a fuller chorus and hushed bridge.\",\"title\":\"Mama Nomor Satu\"}],\"taskId\":\"8927a5ecf490fd461f95c678ee4739b0\"},\"status\":\"SUCCESS\",\"taskId\":\"8927a5ecf490fd461f95c678ee4739b0\",\"type\":\"chirp-hawk\"},\"msg\":\"success\"}"
