time=2026-11-15T23:33:20.178+07:00 level=DEBUG msg="ai provider request" provider=minimax method=POST url=https://api.minimax.io/v1/text/chatcompletion_v2 api_key=sk-cp-…-uTs model=MiniMax-M3.1-Flash timeout=2m0s body="{\"max_completion_tokens\":8192,\"messages\":[{\"content\":\"You are an award-winning songwriter who writes personal, heartfelt songs as gifts.\\nWrite ONE complete song from the customer's answers.\\n\\nRules:\\n- Language of the lyrics: Bahasa Indonesia. Natural, singable, not translated-sounding.\\n- Mention the recipient by name or nickname naturally (at least in the chorus).\\n- Use the special qualities, the memory and the message as concrete images, not as a list.\\n- Structure with section tags on their own lines: [Intro], [Verse], [Pre Chorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro].\\n- The first [Chorus] must start within the first 60 seconds of the song (keep [Intro] and the first [Verse] short):\\n  listeners only hear a 60-second preview.\\n- Song length 2–3 minutes. Lyrics at most 2500 characters.\\n- No profanity, hate, sexual content, or real public figures.\\n- style_prompt: English, max 300 characters, comma-separated: genre, sub-genre, mood, vocal type (choose male or female, whichever suits the song best),\\n  main instruments, tempo (BPM). No artist names.\\n\\nReply with ONLY this JSON object, no markdown, no explanation:\\n{\\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"lyrics\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"style_prompt\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"vocal_gender\\\": \\\"male|female\\\", \\\"language\\\": \\\"id|en\\\", \\\"mood\\\": \\\"...\\\"}\",\"role\":\"system\"},{\"content\":\"Song recipient: Anak (Sung by a parent to their child: pride, protection, hopes for the future.)\\nName: Louie, nickname: Uwi\\nOccasion: Ulang Tahun (Birthday celebration: joyful, wishes for the year ahead.)\\nGenre: Pop (modern pop, catchy chorus, polished production)\\nVocal: choose male or female, whichever suits the song best\\nMood: sesuai momen\\nWhat makes them special: Selalu berbagi dan membantu, malu jika dipuji\\nFavorite memory: Waktu dijemput pertama keluar dari sekolah.\\nMessage from the heart: Terima kasih sudah memilih menjadi anak kami\",\"role\":\"user\"}],\"model\":\"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash\"}"
